# Interaction Adapter

- DnDGem owns the interaction abstraction.
- Planned initial web provider: `@dnd-kit/dom` (DND-1.6).
- Do not install dnd-kit until DND-1.6 unless there is a clear infrastructure-only reason.
- Never import dnd-kit from `@dndgem/core`.
- Never expose dnd-kit types through DnDGem public APIs.
- Provider must remain replaceable (contract tests + rollback possible).
- No custom native DnD engine in Phase 1.
